---
import GenericPageLayout from '../../layouts/GenericPageLayout.astro';
import styles from '../../styles/about.module.css';
---

<GenericPageLayout 
  title="NUC Virtual Library" 
  subtitle="National Universities Commission E-Learning & Resource Directory."
  heroImage="/media/DSC_4898.webp"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { label: 'Library', href: '/library' },
    { label: 'NUC e-Library', href: '/library/nuc' }
  ]}
>
  <div class={styles.contentWrapper}>
    <h2 class={styles.heading2}>National Repository of Knowledge</h2>
    <p class={styles.paragraph}>
      The National Universities Commission (NUC) Virtual Library is a centralized digital repository designed to support learning, teaching, and research across all Nigerian universities. FUAZ is fully integrated into this network, providing our students with a gateway to a massive wealth of academic resources.
    </p>

    <div class={styles.navGrid}>
      <div class={styles.navCard}>
        <h3>Theses & Dissertations</h3>
        <p>Access thousands of verified post-graduate theses from Nigerian universities across diverse agricultural and technical fields.</p>
      </div>
      <div class={styles.navCard}>
        <h3>Open Courseware</h3>
        <p>Download curriculum-standard course materials, lecture notes, and instructional videos curated by the NUC for federal institutions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class={styles.heading2}>Core Features</h2>
    <ul class={styles.list}>
      <li><strong>Institutional Repositories:</strong> Links to individual digital archives of all accredited Nigerian universities.</li>
      <li><strong>Indigenous Journals:</strong> Access to peer-reviewed journals published locally within the Nigerian university system.</li>
      <li><strong>Regulatory Standards:</strong> Direct access to NUC guidelines, accreditation reports, and university rankings.</li>
    </ul>

    <p class={styles.paragraph}>
      Students are encouraged to register their library cards at the FUAZ ICT unit to receive their unique NUC login credentials for unrestricted remote access.
    </p>
  </div>
</GenericPageLayout>
